msgstr "DIFF3"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "May 2023"
msgstr "2023년 5월"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "diffutils 3.10"
msgstr "diffutils 3.10"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "사용자 명령"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "이름"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "diff3 - compare three files line by line"
msgstr "diff3 - 세 파일을 행 단위로 비교합니다"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "요약"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<diff3> [I<OPTION>]... I<MYFILE OLDFILE YOURFILE>"
msgstr "B<diff3> [I<옵션>]... I<내파일 이전파일 네파일>"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "설명"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Compare three files line by line."
msgstr "세 파일을 행 단위로 비교합니다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr "긴 옵션의 필수 인자값은 짧은 옵션에서도 마찬가지입니다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-A>, B<--show-all>"
msgstr "B<-A>, B<--show-all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output all changes, bracketing conflicts"
msgstr "모든 바뀐 내용 및 괄호 문제 출력"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-e>, B<--ed>"
msgstr "B<-e>, B<--ed>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output ed script incorporating changes from OLDFILE to YOURFILE into MYFILE"
msgstr ""
"변경 내용이 들어간 B<ed>(1) 스크립트를 출력합니다 I<이전파일>에서 I<네파일>"
"과 비교 후 I<내파일>로 병합"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-E>, B<--show-overlap>"
msgstr "B<-E>, B<--show-overlap>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but bracket conflicts"
msgstr "B<-e>와 유사하나 괄호 문제를 검사합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-3>, B<--easy-only>"
msgstr "B<-3>, B<--easy-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but incorporate only nonoverlapping changes"
msgstr "B<-e>와 유사하나, 비중복 변경만 확인합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-x>, B<--overlap-only>"
msgstr "B<-x>, B<--overlap-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but incorporate only overlapping changes"
msgstr "B<-e>와 유사하나, 중복 변경만 확인합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-X>"
msgstr "B<-X>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-x>, but bracket conflicts"
msgstr "B<-x>와 유사하나, 괄호 문제를 검사합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-i>"
msgstr "B<-i>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "append 'w' and 'q' commands to ed scripts"
msgstr "B<ed>(1) 스크립트에 'w'명령과 'q'명령을 덧붙입니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-m>, B<--merge>"
msgstr "B<-m>, B<--merge>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output actual merged file, according to B<-A> if no other options are given"
msgstr ""
"실제 병합한 파일을 출력합니다. 다른 옵션이 없으면 B<-A> 옵션의 동작을 따릅니"
"다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-a>, B<--text>"
msgstr "B<-a>, B<--text>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "treat all files as text"
msgstr "모든 파일을 텍스트 파일로 취급"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--strip-trailing-cr>"
msgstr "B<--strip-trailing-cr>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "strip trailing carriage return on input"
msgstr "입력에 뒤따라오는 캐리지 리턴 문자를 잘라냅니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-T>, B<--initial-tab>"
msgstr "B<-T>, B<--initial-tab>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "make tabs line up by prepending a tab"
msgstr "여러 탭을 탭인 것처럼 줄을 맞춤"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--diff-program>=I<PROGRAM>"
msgstr "B<--diff-program>=I<프로그램>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use PROGRAM to compare files"
msgstr "I<프로그램>으로 파일을 비교합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-L>, B<--label>=I<LABEL>"
msgstr "B<-L>, B<--label>=I<레이블>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use LABEL instead of file name (can be repeated up to three times)"
msgstr "파일 이름 대신 I<레이블>을 활용합니다 (3번 까지 반복할 수 있음)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "이 도움말을 표시하고 나갑니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-v>, B<--version>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "버전 정보를 출력하고 나갑니다"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The default output format is a somewhat human-readable representation of the "
"changes."
msgstr "기본 출력 형식은 바뀐 내용의 가독성 표현 형태입니다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<-e>, B<-E>, B<-x>, B<-X> (and corresponding long) options cause an ed "
"script to be output instead of the default."
msgstr ""
"B<-e>, B<-E>, B<-x>, B<-X> (그리고 관련 긴) 옵션은 기본 출력 대신 B<ed>(1) 스"
"크립트로 출력합니다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Finally, the B<-m> (B<--merge>) option causes diff3 to do the merge "
"internally and output the actual merged file.  For unusual input, this is "
"more robust than using ed."
msgstr ""
"마지막으로 B<-m> (B<--merge>) 옵션은 내부적으로 B<diff3>에서 병합을 진행하게 "
"하며, 실제 병함 파일로 출력합니다.  일반적이지 않은 입력은 B<ed>(1)를 활용하"
"면 더 확실하게 동작합니다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If a FILE is '-', read standard input.  Exit status is 0 if successful, 1 if "
"conflicts, 2 if trouble."
msgstr ""
"I<파일> 값이 '-' 문자라면, 표준 입력을 읽습니다. 종료 상태는 성공시 0, 중복"
"시 1, 문제 발생시 2입니다."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "저자"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Written by Randy Smith."
msgstr "Randy Smith이(가) 작성함."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "REPORTING BUGS"
msgstr "버그 보고"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Report bugs to: bug-diffutils@gnu.org"
msgstr "버그 보고 주소: bug-diffutils@gnu.org"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
