"GNU diffutils home page: E<lt>https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/E<gt>"
msgstr ""
"GNU diffutils 홈페이지: E<lt>https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/E<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "General help using GNU software: E<lt>https://www.gnu.org/gethelp/E<gt>"
msgstr ""
"GNU 소프트웨어 활용 일반 도움말: E<lt>https://www.gnu.org/gethelp/E<gt>"

